00:31:12.700 --> 00:31:14.280
I like traveling shows.

545
00:31:14.700 --> 00:31:15.160
Yeah.

546
00:31:15.440 --> 00:31:20.220
You know, the Muni is where I was really introduced to live musical theater.

547
00:31:20.580 --> 00:31:26.880
My mom would take me and like you said, it's 12,000 seats and we could only afford seats

548
00:31:26.880 --> 00:31:27.840
kind of way in the back.

549
00:31:28.060 --> 00:31:28.260
Right.

550
00:31:28.260 --> 00:31:33.780
You would rent binoculars and so you would watch these performances through binoculars,

551
00:31:34.380 --> 00:31:40.820
but the sound in this outdoor amphitheater, it was just, and it would be like a warm summer

552
00:31:40.820 --> 00:31:41.960
