553
00:31:42.340 --> 00:31:44.900
You wait for the sun to go down, right?

554
00:31:45.360 --> 00:31:45.880
Exactly.

555
00:31:45.880 --> 00:31:48.440
You wait for it to get dark and then the show starts.

556
00:31:48.940 --> 00:31:55.860
And my gosh, just some just joyous moments from my childhood going to the Muni to see shows.

557
00:31:55.860 --> 00:31:56.420
Yeah.

558
00:31:56.600 --> 00:32:01.780
So it's really meaningful for like a St. Louis person to then get to star in a show there.

559
00:32:01.920 --> 00:32:02.360
I'm sure.

