608
00:34:06.500 --> 00:34:08.880
It was me and Shannon and this kid named Bill.

609
00:34:09.060 --> 00:34:15.580
There was three of us and I was second chair, but only because there were three of us.

610
00:34:15.600 --> 00:34:16.740
I want to see that.

611
00:34:16.960 --> 00:34:17.820
Oh my gosh.

612
00:34:17.960 --> 00:34:20.880
Phyllis, I couldn't even reach seventh position on the trombone.

613
00:34:20.980 --> 00:34:23.600
I just had to let it slide out because I couldn't reach it.

614
00:34:24.260 --> 00:34:25.140
It's funny.

615
00:34:25.740 --> 00:34:27.060
