00:35:41.700 --> 00:35:47.720
But then Phyllis, I don't know if you remember when I fell down the stairs at the, at the

640
00:35:47.720 --> 00:35:53.840
up front, well, not only did I fracture my back in four places, but I hurt my elbow.

