648
00:36:19.820 --> 00:36:20.780
Play through the pain.

649
00:36:21.300 --> 00:36:24.240
But I, I, yeah, those are my stories.

650
00:36:24.240 --> 00:36:31.100
I, I fiddled with piano and I filled with guitar, but ultimately I never really played

651
00:36:31.100 --> 00:36:31.620
an instrument.

652
00:36:32.080 --> 00:36:33.320
Well, guess what?

653
00:36:33.440 --> 00:36:35.200
I'm not playing the trombone anymore.

654
00:36:35.620 --> 00:36:37.500
And I'm not playing the trombone anymore.

655
00:36:39.200 --> 00:36:39.840
Okay.

