00:39:25.400 --> 00:39:29.260
Well, as we know, our girl is going through puberty.

716
00:39:29.260 --> 00:39:30.720
She's starting puberty.

717
00:39:31.080 --> 00:39:35.300
So, her emotions have expanded, let's say.

718
00:39:35.820 --> 00:39:36.300
Oh, yeah.

719
00:39:37.160 --> 00:39:44.500
I think her original emotions are all taken back by all the other ones that surface.

720
00:39:44.500 --> 00:39:52.960
And I'm really looking forward to it because, as I said, I did a lot of my recordings singularly

721
00:39:52.960 --> 00:39:53.360
here.

722
00:39:53.360 --> 00:40:02.280
I'm anxious to see how we all fit together in her mind because there are, golly, I think

